    "https://njit.wd108.myworkdayjobs.com/NJIT_Careers/job/Central-King-Building/Post-Doctoral-Research-Associate_JR100348": {
      "title": "Post Doctoral Research Associate",
      "description": "Start date: 2026-09-08\nPosted: Posted 30+ Days Ago\nFull time\n\nAre you a current NJIT employee? Apply here through the Internal Jobs Hub.     Title: Post Doctoral Research Associate     Department: Biological Sciences      Reports To: Chair        Position Summary: The Fluid Locomotion Laboratory at the New Jersey Institute of Technology, led by Prof. Brooke Flammang, invites applications for a postdoctoral research associate or senior research position in the field of underwater attachment mechanics and bioinspired design. Position will begin as soon as October 2026.   Essential Functions: The position will involve aiding in the development and testing of physical models of underwater attachment mechanisms, building upon the research group's efforts in biologically inspired attachment (https://bflammang.wixsite.com/fluidlocolab/research). Pre-Requisite Qualifications: A PhD in Biology, Mechanical and Aerospace Engineering, or a related area with experience in comparative biomechanics, robotics, and/or fluid dynamics is required A very strong quantitative background, including statistics and computer programming Excellent written and oral communication skills, shown by a strong publication record and presentations at conferences Excellent organizational, project management, data analysis and data management skills A strong interest in conducting interdisciplinary work as part of a collaborative team  A strong interest in mentoring undergraduate and graduate students and broadening participation in STEM At the university's discretion, the education and experience prerequisites may be exempted where the candidate can demonstrate to the satisfaction of the university an equivalent combination of education and experience specifically preparing the candidate for success in the position.            Union: United Council of Academic @ NJIT (UCAN GSRE)            Range: Post Docs            Compensation: $63,480.00   NJIT considers factors such as (